description:
Otis just got a supersized upgrade. From a giant dog-food scoop to a custom name tag and slow-feeder bowl, the Bambu Lab A2L turns pet projects into prints of every size. Plus, low-odor PLA Pure keeps the home-printing experience comfortable.

All models shown are free from MakerWorld.  Check out the A2L from the link here: https://tidd.ly/4vGKjzK
